@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Configuration acceptance and change control
start
:Review template changes and migration compatibility;
:Validate required tools, paths and production flags;
:Build frontend and production dependencies;
:Validate Nginx and PHP-FPM configuration;
:Apply reviewed environment and rebuild caches;
:Reload affected services and worker;
:Check ingress, sessions, Git operations and storage;
if (All candidate checks pass?) then (yes)
 :Record commit, sanitized configuration evidence and operator;
else (no)
 :Keep writes blocked and follow reviewed recovery procedure;
endif
stop
@enduml
